{
"Items.HuntsmansCane.Desc": "A lightweight staff that once belonged to the Erlking. This ebony-black cane is made of polished wood and topped with a golden cap in the shape of a deer's head. It seems too light and delicate to be an effective weapon, but you could use it as such, though at the risk of breaking it."
"Items.HuntsmansCane.Long": "a cane that once belonged to Erlking"
"Items.HuntsmansCane.Short": "Huntsman's Cane"
}
